app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: ku hava loader ya Vulkan eka sisiteme leyi, kutani ku hava lexi nga tirhisiwaka ku dirowa.\n\nSchist yi dirowa hi Vulkan, naswona `libvulkan.so.1` a yi nghenisiwanga.\nKu laveka loader ni driver havumbirhi:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: driver ya Vulkan leyi session leyi yi kongomisiweke eka yona a yi kona.\n\n{var} yi vekiwile, naswona ku yi veka swi *siva* ku lava ka loader\ndriver ematshan'wini yo engetela eka kona. Kutani tifayili leti, leti nga riki kona,\nhi tona nongonoko hinkwawu wa tidriver — naswona phurogireme yin'wana ni yin'wana ya Vulkan eka session leyi\na yi voni driver nikatsongo, hambiloko ku nghenisiwe to tala:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYi kongomise eka manifest leyi nga kona — tidriver leti nghenisiweke ti veka ta tona eka\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — kumbe u yi susa kutani u pfumelela loader yi tilavela.\nLoko session yi veka leswi ku suka eka fayili ya config (Hyprland `env =`,\nfayili ya systemd environment.d, kumbe phurofayili ya shell), swi fanele ku cinciwa kwalaho,\nnaswona u fanele u nghena nakambe leswaku ku cinca ku fika eka leswi se swi tirhaka.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} yi vekiwile eka {value}, naswona leswi swi siva ndlela leyi loader yi tilavelaka ha yona:\nloko ku nga ri na manifest ya muchini lowu eka tona, xo sungula ku ringeta i ku yi susa.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: ku hava driver ya Vulkan leyi nghenisiweke, kutani ku hava lexi nga tirhisiwaka ku dirowa.\n\nSchist yi dirowa hi Vulkan. Loader yi nghenisiwile kambe yi vika leswaku ku hava\ndriver — ku hava leyi titsariseke eka tindhawu letimbirhi leti lavisisiwaka:\n\n{dirs}\n\nLoader yi fambisiwa yi hambane ni tidriver, kutani hakanyingi ku kayivela package yin'we ntsena.\n\nNghenisa driver ya GPU ya muchini lowu:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nDriver ya NVIDIA ya vini yi ta ni ya yona (`nvidia-utils` eka Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` eka Debian). Eka muchini wa xivirtual, kumbe kun'wana laha ku nga riki\nna driver ya GPU yo nghenisa, rasteriser ya software hi yona yi tirhaka:\n`vulkan-swrast` eka Arch, naswona i xiphemu xa `mesa-vulkan-drivers` kun'wana. Yi\nnonoka, kambe ya sungula.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: driver ya Vulkan yi nghenisiwile kambe a yi nyiki xitirhisiwa xo dirowa ha xona.\n\nDriver yi nga ha va yi nga seketeli GPU leyi, kumbe yi nga koti ku yi fikelela —\nhi SSH kumbe endzeni ka container, /dev/dri hakanyingi ya kayivela.\n`vulkaninfo --summary` yi vika leswi loader yi swi vonaka.\n\nRasteriser ya software yi dirowa handle ka GPU loko muchini lowu wu ri tano:\n`vulkan-swrast` eka Arch, naswona i xiphemu xa `mesa-vulkan-drivers`\neka Debian na Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ku sungula Schist hambiswiritano u yi tshika yi tsandzeka hi ndlela ya yona, veka {var}=1.
